WEBVTT

1
00:00:07,310 --> 00:00:12,810
Don't panic, everyone, there are only number 20 people in the Tianhe Gang. If we unite for a day, we can fight.

2
00:00:15,520 --> 00:00:17,520
Uncle Liu, fortunately you are here.

3
00:00:17,520 --> 00:00:24,730
It's no use relying on me alone.

4
00:00:24,730 --> 00:00:27,920
My family hasn't eaten for several days, and I'm so hungry that I have no energy.

5
00:00:27,920 --> 00:00:31,990
Now the only one who can fight against the outside world is Zhang Yi.

6
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:35,990
Zhang Yi's family has weapons and is full of food every day to keep him strong.

7
00:00:35,990 --> 00:00:38,990
Letting him lead us is the most appropriate choice.
